            <div xml:id="d357">

                <pb facs="0314" n="308" xml:id="pg308"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1163/876: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-03-28T17:00:00+09:00">March 28, 1939—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 28—6:28 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>151. Department’s 76, March 27, 8 p.m., bombing of mission properties. I do not
                    see how any other conclusion is possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
